<quiz>
    <question type="gapselect">
        <name>
            <text>4.2.3.6 Positivität in Quadranten [Positivity in quadrants]</text>
        </name>
        <questiontext format="html">
            <text><![CDATA[
<p class="HELM_exercise">
    <span class="multilang" lang="en">
        Exercise
    </span>
    <span class="multilang" lang="no">
        Øving
    </span>
    <span class="multilang" lang="de">
        Übung
    </span>
    <br/>
</p>
<span class="multilang" lang="en">
    Which trigonometric functions are positive in each of the 4 quadrants?
</span>
<span class="multilang" lang="no">
    Hvilke trigonometriske funksjoner er positive i hver av de 4 kvadrantene?
</span>
<span class="multilang" lang="de">
    Welche trigonometrischen Funktionen sind in den einzelnen 4 Quadranten positiv?
</span>
<br/>
<ol class="HELM_parts">
    <li>
        <span class="multilang" lang="en">
            First quadrant
        </span>
        <span class="multilang" lang="no">
            Første kvadrant
        </span>
        <span class="multilang" lang="de">
            Erster Quadrant
        </span>
        \(\left( 0 \leq \theta \leq \dfrac{\pi}{2} \right)\): [[1]]
    </li>
    <li>
        <span class="multilang" lang="en">
            Second quadrant
        </span>
        <span class="multilang" lang="no">
            Andre kvadrant
        </span>
        <span class="multilang" lang="de">
            Zweiter Quadrant
        </span>
        \( \left(\dfrac{\pi}{2} \leq \theta \leq \pi \right)\): [[2]]
    </li>
    <li>
        <span class="multilang" lang="en">
            Third quadrant
        </span>
        <span class="multilang" lang="no">
            Tredje kvadrant
        </span>
        <span class="multilang" lang="de">
            Dritter Quadrant
        </span>
        \(\left( \pi \leq \theta \leq \dfrac{3\pi}{2} \right)\) : [[3]]
    </li>
    <li>
        <span class="multilang" lang="en">
            Fourth quadrant
        </span>
        <span class="multilang" lang="no">
            Fjerde kvadrant
        </span>
        <span class="multilang" lang="de">
            Vierter Quadrant
        </span>
        \( \left(\dfrac{3\pi}{2} \leq \theta \leq 2\pi \right)\): [[4]]
    </li>
</ol>
]]></text>
